        nnwwcchhaann       Wait channel (as an address).

        oouubbllkk        Alias: oouubblloocckk.  Total blocks written.

        pp__rruu         Resource usage (valid only for zombie processes).

        ppaaddddrr        Swap address.

        ppaaggeeiinn       Pageins (same as mmaajjfflltt).

